td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F14C0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F1720"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F1980"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F1BE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F2090"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F22F0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F2550"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F27B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F2FE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F3240" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Agency Partner,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F3700"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F3960" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F3E20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F4080" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><span data-teams="true"><p>Thank you for reaching out via the NDC Technology Contact Us form.</p><p><br></p><p>Based on our review, this enquiry relates to booking servicing rather than an NDC technology issue. For assistance with servicing your customer’s booking, please continue to follow your usual servicing channels.</p><p><br></p><p>If your booking departure is within 3 business days, we recommend contacting your local Qantas Agency Connect team for immediate support.</p><p><br></p><p>Should you encounter any technical issues with your NDC connection in the future, please feel free to submit a new enquiry via the Contact Us form.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your understanding and for your continued support of Qantas NDC.</p></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F53B0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F55F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F5700"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F5940">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F5BA0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F5DE0">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F63D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F6630" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F6AF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F6D50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F8820"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F8A80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F8CE0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F8F40"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F91A0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000131F9400" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cel